  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Wiring contract",
      "items": [
        "createSpeakOrNoSpeak() merges options, builds engine + TurnDetector, and pumps frames — the mic opens only in start() (speak-or-no-speak.js:40-52, 109-120, 162-188)",
        "The app drives start/stop/setAgentSpeaking; the facade delivers onSpeechStart, onTurnEnd, onInterrupt (speak-or-no-speak.js:130-160, 209-211)",
        "The page loads pinned CDN scripts; the adapter reads window.vad, the models read window.ort (index.html:183-184, silero-vad-adapter.js:362, smart-turn.js:45)",
        "MicVAD.new is timeout-guarded (8 s): an AudioWorklet hang retries the documented ScriptProcessor path (silero-vad-adapter.js:296-339)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Degradation ladder",
      "items": [
        "Silero failing to load (cdn-unavailable / engine-load-failed / audio-pipeline) switches to EnergyVad; degraded.engine = \"energy\" (speak-or-no-speak.js:162-188)",
        "AEC scope is classified from track settings (all / remote-only / unknown / none); scope \"none\" or un-routed \"unknown\" arms stricter barge-in gating (aec-scope.js:77-84, 130-138)",
        "Stricter gating: ~300 ms confirm + frame rms > 2× the rolling agent-playback baseline (turn-detector.js:232-248)",
        "Smart-turn errors or the 300 ms timeout fail open — the turn end emits anyway (turn-detector.js:621-628)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Agent flag, echo & voice gates",
      "items": [
        "While the agent flag is armed no turn ends; confirmed speech fires onInterrupt and a 500 ms grace keeps the turn whole (turn-detector.js:554-582)",
        "Turn end uses adaptive redemption: 350–1200 ms derived from the turn's rhythm (turn-detector.js:60-66)",
        "Echo gate (default OFF): normalized cross-correlation against the route's reference tap; either gate alone can reject a frame (echo-correlation.js:38-83, turn-detector.js:239-244)",
        "Voice gate (default OFF): turn audio → kaldi fbank → speaker embedding → cosine vs the committed profile; fail-open suppression (agent-voice-gate.js:204-219, speak-or-no-speak.js:140-156)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Packaging & test surface",
      "items": [
        "STT lives strictly outside the real-time loop — apps wire adapters to onTurnEnd audio only (stt-adapter.js:4-13)",
        "Turn audio = RingBuffer pre-speech pad + accumulated frames, 16 kHz mono (ring-buffer.js:1-14)",
        "npm test runs the Node suite; npm run build:bundle emits ESM/IIFE bundles with vad-web external (package.json:22-27, build-bundle.mjs:48-57)",
        "encodeWav powers the demo's save-last-turn download and the WP6 replay fixtures (wav-export.js:22-52)"
      ]
    }
  ]
